{"step_index":229,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-13T04:20:43Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-13T11:20:43+07:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-13T11:20:43+07:00\nFile Path: `file:///e:/codekids/src/app/api/bibi/route.ts`\nTotal Lines: 118\nTotal Bytes: 3729\nShowing lines 1 to 60\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: import { NextResponse } from \"next/server\";\n2: import { GoogleGenAI } from \"@google/genai\";\n3: import { getChildSession } from \"@/lib/session\";\n4: import { db } from \"@/lib/db\";\n5: \n6: const ai = new GoogleGenAI({\n7:   apiKey: process.env.GEMINI_API_KEY,\n8: });\n9: \n10: export async function POST(req: Request) {\n11:   try {\n12:     const session = await getChildSession();\n13:     if (!session?.childId) {\n14:       return NextResponse.json({ error: \"Unauthorized\" }, { status: 401 });\n15:     }\n16: \n17:     const { missionId, goal, program, attempts, message, history } = await req.json();\n18: \n19:     if (!message) {\n20:       return NextResponse.json({ error: \"Message is required\" }, { status: 400 });\n21:     }\n22: \n23:     // Determine hint level based on hints used (can be inferred from history or just rely on Gemini to increment via its prompt)\n24:     const hintsUsed = history.filter((m: any) => m.role === \"bibi\").length;\n25:     let hintLevel = 1;\n26:     if (hintsUsed >= 2) hintLevel = 3;\n27:     else if (hintsUsed === 1) hintLevel = 2;\n28: \n29:     const programStr = JSON.stringify(program, null, 2);\n30: \n31:     const systemPrompt = `Kamu adalah \"Bibi AI\", tutor coding virtual untuk anak SD (7-12 tahun). \n32: Kamu sedang membantu anak menyelesaikan sebuah misi coding bergaya blok (seperti Scratch).\n33: \n34: Konteks saat ini:\n35: - Misi ID: ${missionId}\n36: - Tujuan Misi: ${goal}\n37: - Jumlah percobaan gagal: ${attempts}\n38: - Tingkat Hint (1-3): ${hintLevel}\n39: - Kode Blok anak saat ini (JSON):\n40: ${programStr}\n41: \n42: ATURAN UTAMA:\n43: 1. JANGAN PERNAH memberikan jawaban langsung, solusi lengkap, atau susunan blok yang benar.\n44: 2. Gunakan bahasa Indonesia sederhana untuk anak SD.\n45: 3. Maksimal 3 kalimat per jawaban. Gunakan emoji secukupnya.\n46: 4. Gaya bicara ramah, menyemangati, dan menyenangkan.\n47: 5. Panduan tingkat hint:\n48:    - Tingkat 1 (Hint 1): Berikan pertanyaan pemandu agar anak berpikir ke arah yang benar.\n49:    - Tingkat 2 (Hint 2): Berikan analogi sehari-hari (misal: menyiram tanaman, membagikan permen) yang sesuai dengan konsep.\n50:    - Tingkat 3 (Hint 3): Berikan petunjuk lebih spesifik (misal: \"coba periksa apakah blok IF kamu ada di tempat yang tepat\").\n51:    Sekarang kamu berada di tingkat hint: ${hintLevel}.\n52: \n53: Sesuaikan jawabanmu dengan pertanyaan anak dan konteks blok yang sudah mereka susun.`;\n54: \n55:     const chatHistory = history.map((m: any) => ({\n56:       role: m.role === \"bibi\" ? \"model\" : \"user\",\n57:       parts: [{ text: m.content }]\n58:     }));\n59: \n60:     // Add current message to chat history format\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
